@startuml 视图矩阵构建流程
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #FFF3E0
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #EF6C00
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
skinparam noteBorderColor #2E7D32
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

title 视图矩阵构建流程

rectangle "Transform组件" as Transform {
    rectangle "位置(Position)" as Pos {
        label "m_Position\n(x, y, z)"
    }
    
    rectangle "旋转(Rotation)" as Rot {
        label "m_Rotation\n(pitch, yaw, roll)"
    }
}

rectangle "摄像机坐标系" as CameraSpace {
    rectangle "Right轴(X)" as Right {
        label "(rx, ry, rz)"
    }
    
    rectangle "Up轴(Y)" as Up {
        label "(ux, uy, uz)"
    }
    
    rectangle "Look轴(Z)" as Look {
        label "(lx, ly, lz)"
    }
}

rectangle "视图矩阵" as ViewMatrix {
    label "View Matrix\n[rx  ux  lx  0]\n[ry  uy  ly  0]\n[rz  uz  lz  0]\n[-dot(R,P) -dot(U,P) -dot(L,P) 1]"
}

note top of Transform
    存储摄像机的
    世界空间变换
end note

Rot --> CameraSpace : 构建坐标轴
note on link
    Right = (1, 0, 0) * RotationMatrix
    Up = (0, 1, 0) * RotationMatrix
    Look = (0, 0, 1) * RotationMatrix
end note

Pos --> ViewMatrix : 计算平移
CameraSpace --> ViewMatrix : 构建旋转部分

note bottom of ViewMatrix
    视图矩阵 = 世界到摄像机空间的变换
    View = Inverse(CameraWorldMatrix)
    
    旋转部分: 坐标轴转置
    平移部分: -dot(Axis, Position)
end note

rectangle "应用示例" as Example {
    label "顶点变换\nposView = mul(posWorld, View)\nposProj = mul(posView, Proj)"
}

ViewMatrix --> Example

@enduml
